          "angle": 270,
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "visible": false,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "borders-and-glyphs-smoke",
          "nodeId": "borders-and-glyphs-smoke-landing"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Borders and glyphs\n\n**Row 1 and 2: borders.** Each card is an HTML-faced node with its own border: colour, width, corner radius and line (solid, dashed, dotted, double). The line you read on the card should be the line it draws. The last two have no border width and the default.\n\n**Row 3: glyphs.** Each is an SVG drawn in its own colour. The last one carries a script and **must not draw**.\n\nThen change one yourself: select a node, and in the Properties panel set its border style, or edit the glyph's SVG."
        }
      }
    },
